+2.  **Pairwise Triangulation:** For each pair of consecutive contours $C_i$ (slice $z_i$) and $C_{i+1}$ (slice $z_{i+1}$), generate a triangulated ribbon connecting them. The specific triangulation strategy varies by implementation [S1, unofficial]:
